// Low-fidelity wireframes: a checkout flow in grey boxes
// Shows: greyscale only, two text weights, image placeholders marked with a cross, text as grey bars, notes beside the frames, arrows between screens; the structure is decided before any colour
// A wireframe file has three greys and one text style family. No brand colour, no shadows.
